 "takeaways": [
  "**A × B = AB sin θ n̂** is a **vector** (right-hand rule).",
  "**Anti-commutative**; **0** if parallel; **AB** if perpendicular.",
  "**î×ĵ = k̂** (cyclic), reversed order gives −."
 ]
